    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Construct is a cozy colony simulation game starring a cast of cute animal characters that can be individually managed. You take the role of a researcher and colonist studying an ancient and mysterious totem left behind by a precursor civilization. Your world is a dark 2D hand drawn environment reminiscent of scratchboards, neon, the ZX Spectrum, or Amiga.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START AS A CAMP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/c95b3a642a15d4d8c9a3913f0a171768.poster.avif?t=1755107843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/c95b3a642a15d4d8c9a3913f0a171768.webm?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/c95b3a642a15d4d8c9a3913f0a171768.mp4?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp will start small, with just you to look over it. To please the central totem, you will be given a series of tasks to complete; leading to the birth of a new civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW INTO A SETTLEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/ad284454e7bfcbaa5e249b6d187a4d28.avif?t=1755107843\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the totem gains strength, it is able to claim dominion over more land. Utilize this new available space to accomplish further goals. Both set by the totem, and your own will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/e78ff0ad3da7bcae53b7d3ea524d518a.poster.avif?t=1755107843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/e78ff0ad3da7bcae53b7d3ea524d518a.webm?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/e78ff0ad3da7bcae53b7d3ea524d518a.mp4?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your settlement grows, new pawns will arrive to the colony. Pawn species and cloak can be customized for synergistic and organizational purposes. Each pawn has traits which change the way they interact with their fellow settlers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LET THEM DO THEIR JOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/b423a5841231dc6817d5f62325a28df9.poster.avif?t=1755107843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/b423a5841231dc6817d5f62325a28df9.webm?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/b423a5841231dc6817d5f62325a28df9.mp4?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pawns will take up jobs you assign them, and will sometimes act in their own interests. Clever arrangements of pawn jobs can be used to automate many crafting tasks.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Construct is a cozy colony simulation game starring a cast of cute animal characters that can be individually managed. You take the role of a researcher and colonist studying an ancient and mysterious totem left behind by a precursor civilization. Your world is a dark 2D hand drawn environment reminiscent of scratchboards, neon, the ZX Spectrum, or Amiga.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >START AS A CAMP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/c95b3a642a15d4d8c9a3913f0a171768.poster.avif?t=1755107843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/c95b3a642a15d4d8c9a3913f0a171768.webm?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/c95b3a642a15d4d8c9a3913f0a171768.mp4?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp will start small, with just you to look over it. To please the central totem, you will be given a series of tasks to complete; leading to the birth of a new civilization.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GROW INTO A SETTLEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/ad284454e7bfcbaa5e249b6d187a4d28.avif?t=1755107843\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the totem gains strength, it is able to claim dominion over more land. Utilize this new available space to accomplish further goals. Both set by the totem, and your own will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CREATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/e78ff0ad3da7bcae53b7d3ea524d518a.poster.avif?t=1755107843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/e78ff0ad3da7bcae53b7d3ea524d518a.webm?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/e78ff0ad3da7bcae53b7d3ea524d518a.mp4?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your settlement grows, new pawns will arrive to the colony. Pawn species and cloak can be customized for synergistic and organizational purposes. Each pawn has traits which change the way they interact with their fellow settlers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LET THEM DO THEIR JOBS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/b423a5841231dc6817d5f62325a28df9.poster.avif?t=1755107843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/b423a5841231dc6817d5f62325a28df9.webm?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471640/extras/b423a5841231dc6817d5f62325a28df9.mp4?t=1755107843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These pawns will take up jobs you assign them, and will sometimes act in their own interests. Clever arrangements of pawn jobs can be used to automate many crafting tasks.</p>",
